# Local test scratch
/tmp/

# Claude Code local state. settings.local.json holds per-session
# permission grants (domain allowlists, shell-command allowlists), and
# scheduled_tasks.lock pins a current session id; neither should ever
# leave the local machine. A shared `.claude/settings.json` (hooks,
# team-wide config) CAN be committed if this project ever adds one —
# un-ignore it explicitly when doing so.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/projects/

